<description>&lt;p&gt;Thai forces have deployed F-16 jets to the Tak border and are reviewing policy after construction vehicles were torched in Yala and attacks continued in three southern provinces. The Thai foreign minister met Myanmar’s Min Aung Hlaing to discuss border security and raised concerns about arsenic-tainted rivers affecting cross-border water. Cambodia’s military recruitment drive exceeded its target by 50%, and Thailand warned Cambodia not to raise the border dispute at the Francophonie summit. Bank of England, Singapore and Thailand completed a cross-border FX settlement trial, advancing regional financial integration. 35 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxPYko2TXRuRkZsdy04WmdzaW95MzJCTjdfVjFiS1llRGEzOHJCbWpXS1ZTcFJNeS1RVlNRN1RDd2F6OVdYeTVBaHNITWFJX3ZPRkdwVDhiV0tsOFk1eEk3ZkZUSFVnTTN5Tm9pa05qQWZuaUFuYWhGbW5PekxvRGxkUTJfT0VzTmU2Q2VZLVJtd2E3cXVrdml2WjdISkJtNWV5eXZDS2pQc1c?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Daily Dazzling Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxOS2dxa3BjSXFxcktBbjFhbkZYNEVhMVdYMjFUeDZwSUNfZUluRDJpODlBem9OQU9QZVhIXzN1V3g3RVJoREVVSkg4b0RKSTg3ZTZ2TS1PWFlKQU9kNUgtN3hWa2d5NUE0R0xOVnJDV3VhM2ltRklMMkx5d3lpU1Bza0JnVXdxczVDNFdfRmFWcjR1RElpUTF5dm5DTm1FblYyMTdNdGRUTGJ6TVJUT3h1TTB3?oc=5&quot;&gt;Nikkei Asia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixAFBVV95cUxNT2t6UFZhUUZNQm9FMF9ZWVBhRVdHVDFNWVlQSjdoUHp6dGp5WWlWOHRTS2M2aU1MaFZWQVdwaUhaU2lMWUtLbFk4bWwwaXl2dDd0TnJ6UUctWGIwaDJab1l5d29WUnNKWjEyeEZhSVI1UFRoUFYxNVZ3RkdSQzlyV3E1bG1lVEtKbXFxVDBhcjl1VTQwcGFxdDBrTy1UbU5qOUhvQ05oeWQzaV9vUlRuUEhDYVZucW4zbkoyd3hXeUlsdDJJ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bloomberg.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiZEFVX3lxTE9mc0NSSnNkaW9jcjlCRUUycjZtR2cyZERXWUh5M3lCRGJaSmRTb3ZtQWU1R